# Render a diagram from the command line > Zoomed out: one command
# ipm-overview:docs/use-cases/render-diagram.md#L70
# ef1b92d59b7512ac69f84f6910bebca21635b2ee

# The same whole event as above, told at one step instead of four.
render::a Render one diagram ::e

ipmsvg-gen, src::a hello.ipmt, svg::a hello.ipm.svg --> render
user::a User --> render

ipmsvg-gen --> renderer ::c, command-line tool ::c
src --> ipmt text ::c, input ::c
svg --> ipm SVG ::c, output ::c
user --> Author ::c
